{"server":"cn","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_06_end","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_06","title":"夜半歌声","storyCode":"HE-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"dc8231ff22d5a3292f083d1c655290b16c68f396b3d2166d82209731c66410b5","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g11_monasterycorridor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱蒙德，等一下......莱蒙德！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要干什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带你离开这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情我都听说了，那些人别想就这么抓到你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你别害怕，跟我走就好，我们都会帮你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？不......我没有害怕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱蒙德，你先松手......你误会了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉！是我太着急了......很疼吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你听我说，莱蒙德！我是、我是自愿跟他们去拉特兰的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说胡话了！他们拿什么威胁你了？你去那里会死的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也是我罪有应得！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别管我了，莱蒙德，没有人强迫我也没有人威胁我，是我害了菲娜，我不能就这么逃走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德尔菲娜......那是个意外......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！我不想连你也说什么“那是个意外”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意外......意外！是啊，我怎么可能会故意拿铳对着菲娜，那只是个可悲的意外......但是菲娜真的死了！死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱蒙德，菲娜不会再睁开眼睛，不会再和我们说话了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"福尔图娜，冷静......别这样抓，别伤到你自己！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想冷静下来的......我也不想这样又哭又叫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是为什么没有人因此责备我？！为什么所有人都说只是个意外，好像菲娜她的死用一个轻飘飘的“意外”就可以一笔带过一样？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲娜她、她被我杀死了！是不是意外有区别吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......喘气，别憋着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好点了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，我不该这样......但是莱蒙德，我不知道该怎么办才好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道......我不能走，不能逃，不能当作什么都没有发生，不能真的认可那是个意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我的罪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你别担心我，莱蒙德，或许也没有那么糟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯普莉雅，就是今天来的那位拉特兰的使者小姐，她对我很好，我没有吃什么苦头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许回到拉特兰后他们会把我关起来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我长出了角......我也不知道现在我还算不算是萨科塔，不过，就算不是也没什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，我没事的，莱蒙德，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然还是不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"福尔图娜，我不能就这么放着你不管——"},{"type":"narration","text":"莱蒙德？你怎么了......\n呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（先别说话！屏住呼吸......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......有人过来了！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g11_monasterycorridor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他挂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么不知道，你居然已经把里凯莱策反了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"策反谈不上，他就是那种人，只做对自己有利的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在自保这方面，他比我还有本事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总觉得好像有人在盯着我看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，奥伦你是终于多疑到出现幻觉了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起幻觉，我更愿意相信是真的有什么人躲在角落里偷听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，别那样看我，开个玩笑而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你看着的那个堕天使小姑娘呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她啊，应该已经乖乖睡着了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别扯了，说回正题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚刚说计划提前？可以是可以，不过这可和说好的不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么突然修改计划？给我一个理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对你来说没什么区别不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是没什么区别，所以我也可以选择不合作喽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果我没记错，这次的调动权在我，斯普莉雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以回去写检讨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像有点急躁，奥伦。到底怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次本来就不是摆在台面上的行动，如果不是教宗阁下忽然被什么圣徒的事情吸引了注意，要调动部队可没有那么容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是这样，教宗阁下似乎还是察觉到了什么，还特地派了费德里科......啧，想要瞒住费德里科那家伙有多难你不会不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真觉得自己瞒住了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概率没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也算是摸清楚他的性子了，只要他不深究，就问题不大。反正我们的目的只是拦截所有想离开的人不是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反而是你，奥伦，一旦你下令让部队动手，这事可就真的瞒不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科不是会在意手段的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可不好说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提前申明，他要是想对你动手，我没这个本事拦住他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是可悲的同事情谊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁会在这时候联络我......呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你自己看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来是完全没瞒住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的那些我自会处理，斯普莉雅，现在按我说的去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让能行动的部队都过来，立刻由我们的人接管整座修道院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真有这么急？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个和修道院同生共死六十年的老人，为了那些萨卡兹一意孤行，甚至能做出扣押拉特兰使者这种事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他被逼到绝路，却忽然松口，还提出要做“最后的道别”如此有仪式感的事......你觉得会是因为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再加上一群有点来头的萨卡兹，还有隐身在暗处的几位“客人”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的动作要快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我总有种不好的预感......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接管......？什么意思......为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还不明白吗？！那个萨科塔一直都在骗我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得去告诉杰拉尔德老大！我就知道！那些拉特兰人从一开始就没安好心......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"福尔图娜，现在和我一起反而会有危险，你找一个安全的地方等我，他们应该不会立刻对你动手——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，莱蒙德！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我改变主意了。我要和你一起去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g1_monasteryentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好巧啊，两位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安女士，太好了，你安然无恙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么收获吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起来有些忧虑，执行者里凯莱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在追查一件我有点在意的事，和那位主教阁下有关，但......嗯，总之还需要继续调查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，费德里科，你在做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我当然知道你是在工作......你发现什么了？是不是和萨卡兹有关？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说晚上的那场火灾是萨卡兹那边有人心生不满，故意放火，这是真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么新式的娱乐节目吗？你们的即兴相声表演？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玩笑到此为止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玩笑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥伦和斯普莉雅很快会过来会合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，这个口气......费德里科，你从一开始就知道奥伦是故意躲起来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"显而易见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他真不走运，前不久万国峰会的时候才和你对上，这次偏偏又碰上你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，之前奥伦按照自己的判断私自行动，我也是默许的。毕竟安布罗修修道院的情况这么复杂，不留一点后手可不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我总觉得他现在需要一点点提醒......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人联系我说要立刻赶到，还让我捎上奥伦，到底出了什么急事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？奥伦，你终于肯乖乖露面啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，好久不见啊，蕾缪安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这不是在合作完成任务嘛，别说得这么生分......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正因为是合作伙伴，所以现在你还可以站在这里说话哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你有什么样的计划......你那种强硬的做法不太适合现在的修道院，差不多该停手了，奥伦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你和费德里科就不能学学旁边那位，假装什么都不知情吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能别拉我下水吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里凯莱的问题在回到公证所后自然会清算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我谢谢你，奥伦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于你，奥伦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你确实判断有单独行动的必要，可以尝试说服我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这里没有其他人了，我就直说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯普莉雅，你难道真以为我没发现你偷偷摸摸想放走那两个年轻人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个堕天的萨科塔和一个萨卡兹，他们显眼得让我想假装看不见都难啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这家伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坦白说，我早就有点不耐烦这种磨磨蹭蹭的感觉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来你是在指责我的做法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢。不敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我也有我的做法。我们已经在这里耗掉了不少时间，总该考虑考虑，怎么才能尽快完成工作，还不出任何纰漏吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的做法就是私自调动特勤部队？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说得好像这很轻易一样嘛。你知道的，“调动部队”和“下令行动”是两回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了能有一个合适的、妥当的、教宗阁下也无法反对的行动理由，我可是苦恼了好一阵子啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在正好，现成的由头送上门来了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个萨卡兹小子，是叫莱蒙德吧？烧毁圣堂可是大罪，更遑论他还是个萨卡兹，我们接手后不论是扣押还是展开后续调查，都不过分吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烧毁圣堂的犯人不是他，你所谓的理由并不成立。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我查清真相之前，不需要你的队伍介入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真相，哈，真相如何真的那么重要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我们的人接管这里，把一切都安排妥帖，这难道不是最高效、最合理的做法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科，你难道没有这么考虑过？你真有这么看重真相？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥伦，你这样做，难道就不怕这里的居民反抗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安，我以为你不会说这样的傻话。如果有萨卡兹要反抗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是更理想了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥伦","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁在外面！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"叩门声在陡然安静下来的大厅中回响。\n门扉发出令人牙酸的吱呀响声，室外异常明亮的月光透过打开的门缝安静地洒入。\n有人独自站在一线月光中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科先生......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱芒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......终于找到你了，费德里科先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有人，托我把“这个”转交给您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁委托你？这是——"},{"type":"narration","text":"未出口的话音在空气中戛然而止。\n背着光的人影缓慢地走近，瘦高的男人始终低低地垂着头。\n整间屋子的光此时好像都聚集于他一人，可过于刺眼的光亮，又反在人的身上抹出浓重骇人的阴影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"费德里科终于看清对方手上捧着的东西。\n那据说是旁人托克莱芒转交给他的东西。\n一把匕首。\n陈旧但锋利，曾被藏于某人的身后。\n而在匕首旁......\n那用布包裹着，下方被染成红色，还有液体不断溢出的东西。\n......那是什么？\n那是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是......“罪人”霍斯特·蒂芬达尔自愿献上的头颅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“罪人”已承认所有恶事都是其一人所为，所有罪名，都由其一人承担。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如今首恶伏诛，剩下的只是一群流民，不足挂齿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希望......希望拉特兰的各位使者，能够就此手下留情，不再继续追究。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g1_monasteryentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科先生，他、杰拉尔德他在临走前要我对你说——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他请求你，求你带走通缉犯霍斯特的头颅和武器......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放过福尔图娜和莱蒙德......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放过其他萨卡兹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
